        "nodeType": "bounded_task",
        "objective": "Fix WF-A-FORMAL-003: ahra workflow-a advance and workflow-a draft\nmust bound the real AgentDriver call with a configurable timeout\nand a safe default, implemented at the alignment session or\nworkflow_a_cli layer (for example asyncio.wait_for around the\ndriver invocation). On timeout, record a structured timeout error\nand leave the session snapshot consistent and resumable; never\nhang. Do not modify src/ahra/ports.py or the AgentDriver protocol.\nWire a --timeout-seconds CLI option in src/ahra/cli.py for both\nsubcommands. Add a hanging fake-driver test proving the timeout\naborts, the error is structured, and the snapshot is resumable, in\ntests/test_alignment_session.py or tests/test_workflow_a_cli.py.\nRun uv run python -B scripts/check.py --test and record it in\nWorkReport.verification_commands_run.\n",
